== Trivia ==
*The Dojo and Master Tao is likely a reference to real-life Dojo arenas.
*The different coloured [[Belts]] are likely a reference to the different tiers of belts in various martial arts.
*'''Master Tao's''' name could be based on Tao, romanization of the Chinese 道, meaning "Way." Tao is an important concept in Chinese Philosophy as well as some of its religions, such as Taoism. <ref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tao</ref>

